verses.text:
Psa 82:8
8 Arise, O God, judge the earth;
For You shall inherit all nations.

Exo 33:20
20 Yahweh said, “You cannot see My face;
for <strong>no man shall see Me, and live</strong>.”

Gen 1:27
27 So <strong>God created mankind in His own image</strong>;
in the image of God <strong>He created him</strong>;
male and female <strong>He created them</strong><strong>"

Rev 5:10
10 And have made us kings and priests to our God;
And we shall reign on the earth.”
